    {
      "name": "authorize_session",
      "docs": [
        "Lets `key` consent for `program` on the owner's ledger. basenet only; the owner signs.",
        "The first grant for a program adds its 232-byte entry to the store, the owner paying its rent.",
        "`expires_at` zero grants a persisted key into the program's ring of five (a sixth pushes out the oldest); any other value a temporary key in the program's one slot, dead at that unix second."
